### 第 17 阶段：查询活动列表
GET http://localhost:18086/api/events
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-events

### 查询活动详情
GET http://localhost:18086/api/events/1
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-event-detail

### 同步抢票，保存返回的 orderId
POST http://localhost:18086/api/orders/grab
Content-Type: application/json
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-grab

{
  "userId": 9900,
  "sessionId": 101,
  "ticketCategoryId": 1001
}

### 支付订单，把 orderId 换成抢票接口返回值，保存返回的 ticketCode
POST http://localhost:18086/api/orders/replace-with-order-id/pay
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-pay

### 查询订单详情
GET http://localhost:18086/api/orders/replace-with-order-id
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-order

### 查询电子票，把 ticketCode 换成支付接口返回值
GET http://localhost:18086/api/tickets/replace-with-ticket-code
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-ticket

### 核验电子票，把 ticketCode 换成支付接口返回值
POST http://localhost:18086/api/tickets/verify
Content-Type: application/json
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-verify

{
  "ticketCode": "replace-with-ticket-code",
  "verifierId": 7001
}

### 管理端：按用户查询订单，需要 X-Admin-Key
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/users/9900/orders
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-admin-orders
X-Admin-Key: eventrush-admin-key

### 管理端：按订单查询电子票，需要 X-Admin-Key
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/orders/replace-with-order-id/ticket
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-admin-ticket-by-order
X-Admin-Key: eventrush-admin-key

### 管理端：按票码查询电子票，需要 X-Admin-Key
GET http://localhost:18086/api/admin/tickets/replace-with-ticket-code
X-Trace-Id: trace-api-doc-admin-ticket-by-code
X-Admin-Key: eventrush-admin-key
